{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Tree</b> — like a tree of life, whose fruit gives life to whoever eats from it for many years." "<b>And those who hold fast to it</b> — that it will not forsake them, as he said, for wisdom gives life to man, who is a small world."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:54.917293179Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}